#. password was verified, so it says nothing about which accounts exist.
#. English: That code was already used. Wait for the next one and try again
#: src/Maki.Api/Controllers/AccountController.cs
#, fuzzy
msgid "error.account.totpReplayed"
msgstr "这个验证码已经使用过。请等待下一个验证码，然后再试一次。"

#. The two-factor enrolment code was rejected. Distinct from error.auth.invalidCode, which is the
