#: src/Maki.Api/Controllers/AccountController.cs
#, fuzzy
msgid "error.account.invalidContentRating"
msgstr "评级必须是以下值之一：{ratings}"

#. JsonStringEnumConverter accepts the underlying numeric value of an enum as well as its name, so
