#. English: This server requires HTTPS, so your browser would drop the sign-in. Open Maki through its https:// address, or turn off Require HTTPS in Settings (it can be reached from http://localhost on the server).
#: src/Maki.Api/Controllers/AuthController.cs
#, fuzzy
msgid "error.auth.httpsRequired"
msgstr "此服务器要求使用 HTTPS，因此浏览器会丢弃登录状态。请通过 https:// 地址打开 Maki，或在设置中关闭“要求 HTTPS”（可在服务器上通过 http://localhost 访问）。"

#. Also shared across several distinct two-factor failures (missing code, expired 2FA cookie,
